module-oss (OSSv4, illumos):
- open the mixer that belongs to the dsp device (/dev/dspN -> sound/X:Ndsp
  -> /dev/sound/X:Nmixer): SNDCTL_MIXERINFO with mi.dev = N named the
  other device on a machine with two audiohd instances, so the built-in
  audio's volume moved the HDMI volume;
- "Built-in Audio (codec)" / "HDMI / DisplayPort Audio" descriptions, form
  factor and icon from SNDCTL_CARDINFO;
- Speakers and Headphones ports on the mixer's speaker/headphones controls
  (audiohd), an HDMI port for digital-only devices;
- mute in the hardware mixer (volume control to 0, PA's volume back at
  unmute), so that it also silences programs using the devices directly;
- poll the hardware volume and mute every second (OSS has no change
  notification).
OpenIndiana project, 2026.

